@startuml
title 图3　部分对象模型（分析类图）—— UC-12 扫描隐性冲突 / UC-13 处置冲突反馈 / UC-14 翻案误判
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F5F9FF
  BorderColor #2E5AAC
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam enum {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9EC
  BorderColor #C87F0A
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F6FBF7
  BorderColor #1E8449
  FontSize 11
}

class Learner {
  - userId: String
  - displayName: String
  + triggerScan(): ConflictScan
  + viewConflicts(): List<Conflict>
  + giveFeedback(c: Conflict, s: UserState)
  + requestRejudge(p: ClaimPair)
}

class KnowledgeItem {
  - itemId: String
  - title: String
  - content: Text
  - source: ItemSource
  - isDeleted: Boolean
  + extractClaims(): List<Claim>
}

class Claim {
  - claimId: String
  - text: String
}

class ClaimPair <<值对象>> {
  - claimA: Claim
  - claimB: Claim
  + key(): String
}

class Conflict {
  - conflictId: String
  - confidence: Double
  - userState: UserState
  - ignoreCount: Integer
  - createdAt: DateTime
  + evaluate(confidence: Double): Boolean
  + mark(state: UserState, by: Learner)
  + isConverged(): Boolean
  + belongsTo(l: Learner): Boolean
}

class JudgmentLog {
  - pairKey: String
  - confidence: Double
  - verdict: Verdict
  - createdAt: DateTime
  + missed(): Boolean
}

class ConflictScan {
  - scanId: String
  - startedAt: DateTime
  - status: ScanStatus
  + run()
}

enum ConflictType {
  FACT_VS_FACT
  GOAL_VS_ACTION
  CONCEPT_OVERLAP
}

enum UserState {
  UNSEEN
  IGNORED
  ACCEPTED
}

enum Verdict {
  CONFLICT
  COMPLEMENT
  GAP
}

interface LLMJudge {
  + judge(a: Claim, b: Claim): Double
}

Learner "1" --> "0..*" KnowledgeItem : owns
Learner "1" --> "0..*" Conflict : owns
KnowledgeItem "1" *-- "1..*" Claim : 抽取
Conflict "0..*" --> "2" Claim : 涉及
Conflict "0..*" --> "1" ConflictType : 分类
Conflict "0..*" --> "1" UserState : 状态
Conflict "0..1" --> "1" JudgmentLog : 溯源
ConflictScan "1" --> "1" Learner : requester
ConflictScan "1" --> "0..*" Conflict : 产出
ConflictScan ..> LLMJudge : 依赖
ClaimPair "1" --> "2" Claim : 配对
JudgmentLog "1" --> "1" ClaimPair : 判定对象
Learner "1" --> "0..*" JudgmentLog : 复核

note right of ConflictScan
  不变量（E07 补回）：
  run() 只扫描 requester 本人的
  KnowledgeItem，且产出的每条
  Conflict.owner == this.requester。
end note

note bottom of Conflict
  evaluate()：BR-L2-01（<0.5 丢弃 / >=0.5 保留）
  isConverged()：BR-L2-02（同类型忽略 >=3 收敛）
  belongsTo()：支撑越权防护（TABLE 8）
  无通用 setConfidence/setUserState，规则不可绕过。
end note

note bottom of JudgmentLog
  missed() 是翻案依据（UC-14）：人复核判定
  日志后可要求重判，对应 POST
  /l2/judgments/{pair_key}/rejudge。
end note

note bottom of LLMJudge
  LLM 判定是外部依赖接口（IN-01），不作为领域实体；
  无需求依据的类、属性、操作、关系一律删除或待确认。
end note
@enduml
